    <briefdescription>
<para>JSON-schema constraint: required-field list + strict-mode flag. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The enforcer parses <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_json_schema_constraint_1af750c9548a93e999b4995c515ea5d2ff" kindref="member">schema_json</ref></computeroutput> for a top-level <computeroutput>"required"</computeroutput> array and verifies that all listed keys appear in the output object. In <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_json_schema_constraint_1a7da3acf2a7fb4c460e40e7b4d714db15" kindref="member">strict_mode</ref></computeroutput>, keys present in the output but <bold>not</bold> listed under <computeroutput>"properties"</computeroutput> are rejected. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
